\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$28,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Turns refined ores into ingots</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.2.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 21st, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Industrial Forge</b> is the third and final tier of forges. It can be found and purchased at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. Like the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Forge\" title=\"Rusty Forge\">Rusty Forge</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Metal_Forge\" title=\"Metal Forge\">Metal Forge</a>, It is used to smelt refined ores/rocks (which can be done through a refinery) into forged ingots/rocks by putting them through its conveyor, but can smelt larger ores/rocks than the previous two.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The forge bears a similar look to the Metal Forge, being made with a dark metal and having frames on the sides, but with red lines along it, and a grate that lets out smoke from the side of the forge.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163334\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 68/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019487/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.595      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   51.595      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:545-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163334 and revision id 10930. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Structures"],"links":[{"title":"Metal Forge","exists":true},{"title":"Rusty Forge","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Industrial-Forge.png","BoxedIndustrialForge.png"]}
